{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（17日）下午1時40分，一名女清潔工在葵涌梨貝街16號一個斜坡工作期間，懷疑跌倒暈倒，同事見狀報警求助。救援人員到場，發現事主回復清醒，由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。案件列作有人意外受傷處理。</p><figure><img alt=\"事主被送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1166033439107977216167053.jpeg/y_OXhlqV8UOizbzkEOWMYrPINno-Zphthq62f6Outn8\"/><figcaption>事主被送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主被送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1166033436578680832501498.jpeg/Zi-MDMwcYWrkRdjc9w47iC1QfEKIO46mYLQmhEW0JoQ\"/><figcaption>事主被送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同事陪同事主送院。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1166033441482084352127836.jpeg/y00t_Jjo0v11SfNZdW9aL9rZ_SEEnAnzRWGidWBhonU\"/><figcaption>同事陪同事主送院。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T06:58:24.213952+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}